{"speciesId":472,"names":{"fr":"Scorvol","es":"Gliscor","en":"Gliscor","ja":"グライオン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It observes prey while hanging inverted from branches. When the chance presents itself, it swoops!"},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It observes prey while hanging inverted from branches. When the chance presents itself, it swoops!"},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"If it succeeds in catching even a faint breeze properly, it can circle the globe without flapping once."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its flight is soundless. It uses its lengthy tail to carry off its prey... Then its elongated fangs do the rest."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its flight is soundless. It uses its lengthy tail to carry off its prey... Then its elongated fangs do the rest."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Le plus petit courant d’air peut lui donner assez d’élan pour faire le tour du monde sans un coup d’aile."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"If it succeeds in catching even a faint breeze properly, it can circle the globe without flapping once."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Le plus petit courant d’air peut lui donner assez d’élan pour faire le tour du monde sans un coup d’aile."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"If it succeeds in catching even a faint breeze properly, it can circle the globe without flapping once."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It dances silently through the sky. When it approaches prey, it can land a critical hit in an instant."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It dances silently through the sky. When it approaches prey, it can land a critical hit in an instant."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il guette sa proie, pendu à une branche la tête en bas, et s’en saisit à la première occasion."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Espera a sus presas colgado de una rama bocabajo. Cuando 